SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                50
NumberOfInitializationCycles  25
PrintEvery                    10

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeHeatOfAdsorption       yes
ComputeIndividualMoleculeHeatOfAdsorption yes

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 1
ExternalTemperature 300.0
ExternalPressure 1e4

Component 0 MoleculeName       n-hexane
            MoleculeDefinition local
            TranslationProbability 0.5
            RotationProbability 0.5
            ReinsertionProbability 0.5
            SwapProbability 1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0

